{
  "route": "hyperlinks",
  "routeLabel": "Hyperlink entries",
  "scriptId": "0169",
  "lineCount": 95,
  "lines": [
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000007",
      "line": 7,
      "sourceId": "0169:000007",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　抱きしめられる。\n　それは本来、愛情故の行為であるべきだと思う。",
      "english": "She is holding him. An act like this ought, by rights, to come from affection.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000008",
      "line": 8,
      "sourceId": "0169:000008",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000009",
      "line": 9,
      "sourceId": "0169:000009",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　けれど、これは違った。\n　儀礼的なものですらなかった。",
      "english": "But this is different. It is not even a ritual.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000010",
      "line": 10,
      "sourceId": "0169:000010",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "（だったら、これは何だ）",
      "english": "(Then what is it?)",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000011",
      "line": 11,
      "sourceId": "0169:000011",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　分かっている。\n　千鳥がしたいこと、しなければならないこと、そ\nの想いまでも。",
      "english": "He understands. What Chidori wants to do, what she has to do—even the feelings behind it.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000012",
      "line": 12,
      "sourceId": "0169:000012",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　だから、抵抗はできなかった。",
      "english": "That is why he cannot resist.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000013",
      "line": 13,
      "sourceId": "0169:000013",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　忍は千鳥のなすがまま。\n　抱きしめられ、唇を吸われ、口腔を舐られても微動\nだにしてはならない。",
      "english": "Shinobu is entirely at Chidori's mercy. Though she holds him, sucks on his lips, and runs her tongue through his mouth, he must not move a muscle.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000014",
      "line": 14,
      "sourceId": "0169:000014",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　興奮してはならない。",
      "english": "He must not let himself become aroused.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000015",
      "line": 15,
      "sourceId": "0169:000015",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「やめてほしいですか？」",
      "english": "“Do you want me to stop?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000016",
      "line": 16,
      "sourceId": "0169:000016",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「……こんなことをして、どうなるんですか？」",
      "english": "“...What can possibly come of doing this?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000017",
      "line": 17,
      "sourceId": "0169:000017",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「私は、楽しいですよ？」",
      "english": "“I am having fun, you know?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000018",
      "line": 18,
      "sourceId": "0169:000018",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　楽しい。\n　単語一つに、ひどく衝撃を受けた。",
      "english": "Fun. The word alone strikes him like a blow.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000019",
      "line": 19,
      "sourceId": "0169:000019",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「楽しい……？」",
      "english": "“Fun...?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000020",
      "line": 20,
      "sourceId": "0169:000020",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「心が満たされる。安心があるんですから」",
      "english": "“My heart feels full. It puts me at ease.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000021",
      "line": 21,
      "sourceId": "0169:000021",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　唇を吸われる。\n　唾液を飲まれる。",
      "english": "She sucks on his lips. She swallows his saliva.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000022",
      "line": 22,
      "sourceId": "0169:000022",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　そんなことが安心につながるというのだろうか。\n　……つながるのだろう、千鳥にとっては。",
      "english": "Could such a thing really put someone at ease? ...For Chidori, apparently, it does.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000023",
      "line": 23,
      "sourceId": "0169:000023",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「あなただって、あのお友達と理解しあいたいと思\n　ったことはあるでしょう？」",
      "english": "“Surely you've wanted to understand that friend of yours completely too?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000024",
      "line": 24,
      "sourceId": "0169:000024",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「……僕は……」",
      "english": "“...I...”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000025",
      "line": 25,
      "sourceId": "0169:000025",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「心を全て理解することはできません。だから、こ\n　うやって体を重ねて補うんです」",
      "english": "“We cannot understand another heart in its entirety. So we make up for it by joining our bodies this way.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000026",
      "line": 26,
      "sourceId": "0169:000026",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「でもこれは……違います……」",
      "english": "“But this is... different...”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000027",
      "line": 27,
      "sourceId": "0169:000027",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「あなたにとってはそうでしょうね」",
      "english": "“For you, I suppose it is.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000031",
      "line": 31,
      "sourceId": "0169:000031",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「でも私は、これが良いのです」",
      "english": "“But this is what I prefer.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000032",
      "line": 32,
      "sourceId": "0169:000032",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　そう言う千鳥に、忍は逆らえない。\n　抱かれるままに抱かれ、キスされるままにキスさ\nれる。",
      "english": "When she says it, Shinobu cannot defy her. He is held as she wishes to hold him, and kissed as she wishes to kiss him.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000033",
      "line": 33,
      "sourceId": "0169:000033",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "（……姉……さん……）",
      "english": "(...Sis...)",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000034",
      "line": 34,
      "sourceId": "0169:000034",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　いつまで続くのだろう。\n　いつでもそれは唐突で、そこまでの刻は永遠にも\n感じられる。",
      "english": "How long will it continue? It always ends without warning, and the time until then feels like eternity.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000035",
      "line": 35,
      "sourceId": "0169:000035",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　無心になればいい？\n　だが千鳥は、そんな幼稚な意図さえ見抜いてしま\nいそうな気がした。",
      "english": "Could he empty his mind? But he feels that Chidori would see through even such a childish intention.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000036",
      "line": 36,
      "sourceId": "0169:000036",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　どうせ千鳥からは逃げられない。\n　昔からそうだった。\n　ふと、笛子のことを忍は思った。",
      "english": "There is no escaping Chidori anyway. There never has been. Shinobu finds himself thinking of Fueko.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000037",
      "line": 37,
      "sourceId": "0169:000037",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　彼女はこのような行為を認めはしないだろう。\n　罵られるだろう。\n　呆れられるだろう。",
      "english": "She would never condone an act like this. She would berate him. She would be appalled by him.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000038",
      "line": 38,
      "sourceId": "0169:000038",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　そしてもしかすると、惰弱な忍のかわりに千鳥と\n対峙してくれるかも知れない。",
      "english": "And perhaps she would confront Chidori in his place, weak as he was.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000039",
      "line": 39,
      "sourceId": "0169:000039",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　それは。\n　この上なく嬉しい。",
      "english": "That. It would make him happier than anything.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000040",
      "line": 40,
      "sourceId": "0169:000040",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "（けど、それはきっと……）",
      "english": "(But that would surely...)",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000041",
      "line": 41,
      "sourceId": "0169:000041",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　失うことになりかねない。\n　どちらかを。",
      "english": "He might lose one of them. One or the other.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000045",
      "line": 45,
      "sourceId": "0169:000045",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「……忍……」",
      "english": "“...Shinobu...”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000046",
      "line": 46,
      "sourceId": "0169:000046",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　終わりが近い。\n　何故だろうか、いつもこの刻になると名残惜しさ\nに胸が痛む。",
      "english": "The end is near. Why, whenever this moment comes, does his chest ache at the thought of it ending?",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000047",
      "line": 47,
      "sourceId": "0169:000047",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　それは、どうした感情からだろうか。\n　何かを望んでいるというのだろうか。",
      "english": "What sort of feeling gives rise to that? Does it mean there is something he wants?",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000048",
      "line": 48,
      "sourceId": "0169:000048",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "『今日も、いい子でしたね』\nと、かろうじて聞き取れる声で千鳥は終わりを告げる。",
      "english": "“You were a good boy today, too.” In a voice he can barely make out, Chidori signals the end.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000049",
      "line": 49,
      "sourceId": "0169:000049",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「……姉さん」",
      "english": "“...Sis.”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000050",
      "line": 50,
      "sourceId": "0169:000050",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「…………」",
      "english": "“............”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000051",
      "line": 51,
      "sourceId": "0169:000051",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　彼が千鳥に望んだ関係があるとすれば、\nそれは―――",
      "english": "If there is any relationship he wants with Chidori, it is—",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000056",
      "line": 56,
      "sourceId": "0169:000056",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　それは……",
      "english": "It is...",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000057",
      "line": 57,
      "sourceId": "0169:000057",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　…………\n　……",
      "english": "............ ......",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000067",
      "line": 67,
      "sourceId": "0169:000067",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　TITLE:忍\n　\n　\n　話があります\n　明日の夕方、草原で会えませんか？\n　待ってます",
      "english": "TITLE: Shinobu   I need to talk to you. Can you meet me in the meadow tomorrow evening? I'll be waiting.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000079",
      "line": 79,
      "sourceId": "0169:000079",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「！？」",
      "english": "“!?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000080",
      "line": 80,
      "sourceId": "0169:000080",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　唐突に抱きすくめられた。\n　このまま危うい行為に身を任せるものだと思っ\nていた忍は面食らう。",
      "english": "All at once, she pulled him into an embrace. Shinobu had thought he was about to be swept into something dangerous, and the gesture caught him entirely off guard.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000081",
      "line": 81,
      "sourceId": "0169:000081",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　一瞬の安堵。\n　千鳥はこれ以上の非道をなす気はないように思え\nた。",
      "english": "For one instant, relief. It seemed Chidori had no intention of carrying the cruelty any further.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000082",
      "line": 82,
      "sourceId": "0169:000082",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "（だけど……）",
      "english": "(But...)",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000083",
      "line": 83,
      "sourceId": "0169:000083",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　これは、優しさ故の行為ではなかった。\n　それは分かる。分かりたくなくても、抱きしめて\nくる腕の無機質さに、分からされてしまう。",
      "english": "This was not an act of kindness. He knew it. However much he wished otherwise, the lifelessness of the arms around him forced that knowledge on him.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000084",
      "line": 84,
      "sourceId": "0169:000084",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　押し当てられた胸の柔らかさには、男子として\n反応してしまいそうになる。",
      "english": "The softness pressed against him threatened to make his body react despite himself.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000085",
      "line": 85,
      "sourceId": "0169:000085",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　けれどそうした興奮とは無縁な抱擁であることも、\nもう分かっているのだった。",
      "english": "But he already knew that this embrace had nothing to do with any such excitement.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000086",
      "line": 86,
      "sourceId": "0169:000086",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "（虚しいことだ）",
      "english": "(How empty.)",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000087",
      "line": 87,
      "sourceId": "0169:000087",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　貴宮家は空洞化していた。\n　最初からだ。今、空っぽになったわけではない。",
      "english": "The Atemiya household had been hollowed out. It had been that way from the beginning. It had not suddenly become empty now.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000088",
      "line": 88,
      "sourceId": "0169:000088",
      "speakerJa": "千鳥",
      "speakerEn": "Chidori",
      "japanese": "「最初から、こうしていれば……」",
      "english": "“If only it had been like this from the beginning...”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000089",
      "line": 89,
      "sourceId": "0169:000089",
      "speakerJa": "忍",
      "speakerEn": "Shinobu",
      "japanese": "「え……！？」",
      "english": "“What—!?”",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000090",
      "line": 90,
      "sourceId": "0169:000090",
      "speakerJa": "",
      "speakerEn": "",
      "japanese": "　唇を吸われる。\n　息を、そして唾液を吸われ、口腔を舐られる。",
      "english": "She sucked on his lips. She sucked away his breath and saliva, her tongue roaming his mouth.",
      "hyperlinks": [],
      "japaneseHyperlinks": []
    },
    {
      "ref": "saihate:hyperlinks:0169:000091",
